/
ATOMIC_SPECIES
  Zn  65.38   Zn.pbe-dnl-rrkjus_psl.1.0.0.UPF
  O   15.999  O.pbe-n-kjpaw_psl.1.0.0.UPF
ATOMIC_POSITIONS crystal
  Zn  1/3  2/3  0.0
  Zn  2/3  1/3  1/2
  O   1/3  2/3  0.3819
  O   2/3  1/3  0.8819
K_POINTS automatic
  8 8 5 0 0 0
